WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.723
India speaks hundreds of languages.

2
00:00:02.723 --> 00:00:04.430
Most belong to just four

3
00:00:04.430 --> 00:00:05.572
families.

4
00:00:05.919 --> 00:00:08.282
Indo-Aryan languages are spoken by

5
00:00:08.282 --> 00:00:09.348
most Indians.

6
00:00:09.348 --> 00:00:10.633
Dravidian languages,

7
00:00:10.633 --> 00:00:12.177
mainly in the south.

8
00:00:12.177 --> 00:00:14.851
Austro-Asiatic languages like Santali,

9
00:00:14.851 --> 00:00:16.880
and Tibeto-Burman ones in the

10
00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:18.103
north-east.

11
00:00:18.457 --> 00:00:20.232
The Eighth Schedule lists 22

12
00:00:20.232 --> 00:00:23.173
languages, with four added in

13
00:00:23.173 --> 00:00:24.223
2003.

14
00:00:24.562 --> 00:00:26.865
The topic also covers religion

15
00:00:26.865 --> 00:00:28.868
and tribal regions.

16
00:00:29.217 --> 00:00:30.388
Your turn.

17
00:00:30.388 --> 00:00:31.919
Which family?
